  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Agriculture/Food Production Grant</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cooperativa de Servicios Agropecuarios 25 de Julio (25 de Julio), located in the municipality of Victoria, Yoro, will help its members improve their income by developing the cooperative&apos;s administrative skills, conducting training, offering credit in partnership with a community savings-and loan-association, increasing coffee production, pooling harvests to sell in volume and reaching new markets. The work will benefit 105 Hondurans directly and another 550 indirectly.</narrative>
  </description>
